# DFIR Workbench requires no environment variables.
#
# This is intentional, not an oversight: the entire application runs
# client-side (see SDD.md Section 11, System Architecture) — there is no
# backend to configure a URL for, no API key to inject, and no build-time
# secret. This file exists solely to make that explicit so a new
# contributor doesn't go looking for a `.env` that was never needed.
